Drop aerobreakup simualtion. Uses the single grid version of mpcomp. Shockgenerator uses spcomp.

Numerically thickened shock through shock generator capable. (can be turned off for a discontinous shock)
Dimensional and non-dimensional setup capable. (non-dimensional requires viscosity)
Perturbed water cylinder capable. (currently only in 2D)
Connected component labeling is done through cclabel_class.f90 under grid/ directory.

